A major project for us just to get me, you know, one of three of our product team to get that set

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:29.100
Up. It looked like a huge bloated set effort. And so we got really allergic to that. And we're

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:35.490
Starting to look for other ways to do it because yeah I don't want to be in a you know in a command

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:40.560
Command interface or anything like that so that was a little long-winded but that's that's the

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.460
Pains that we were feeling.

